WEBVTT

00:03.080 --> 00:06.900
Second Brother... you truly haven't grown up at all.

00:07.040 --> 00:13.500
The purge against Yu Gong was the Chen clan's doing—just as the Xie clan who backs you was secretly undermining me in Qing Province!

00:14.520 --> 00:23.600
Not only did they sabotage canal excavation, they ignited riots and provoked Father's wrath—leaving the Prince of Ning confined in the palace to this day!

00:26.880 --> 00:30.800
Judging by your stunned expression, you knew nothing of this, did you?

00:32.840 --> 00:39.200
Second Brother, even if you refuse to fight, those standing behind you will fight on your behalf, compelling you forward!

00:39.880 --> 00:43.200
In what dynasty has an imperial prince ever escaped being swept into the vortex?

00:43.760 --> 00:50.800
We are merely the spearheads wielded by those aristocratic houses. Whether we contest or not is never up to you or me!

00:51.400 --> 00:57.200
All of this began the very day our father ascended the dragon throne!

01:01.000 --> 01:06.400
(Father: "How old is your little brother, and you already took him wading to catch fish?!" / Ning: "Didn't you eat the fish as well, Father?")

01:06.640 --> 01:13.200
(Father: "Shielding him like this will bring ruin sooner or later!" / Ning: "Never. I'm the eldest brother—I'll protect him for the rest of my life.")

01:15.320 --> 01:23.500
(Jin: "Where did this duck come from?" / Ning: "I bagged it myself! They call it piercing a poplar at a hundred paces—I call it piercing a duck at a hundred paces! Here, taste it.")

01:23.920 --> 01:30.000
(Jin: "Brother... blood! You're bleeding! We need a medic, you can't go on like this!" / Ning: "It's nothing, don't worry—let's make it to the barge first!")

01:33.760 --> 01:37.500
(Ning: "Protect His Highness! Follow me and hack our way out!")

01:41.960 --> 01:45.800
Eldest Brother... you have changed.

01:46.680 --> 01:48.200
I have changed...?

01:52.840 --> 01:56.500
No, no, no... It is Heaven that has changed.
